,"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按相連人名、語法及所行之事。"}],"source_position":{"revision_id":"cbr-ai-transcription-sha256:505fb3b94d3ff23f1894b6d47f41de271453de9bd7574c3e2c60333ec3e61159","source_layer":"received_biography","column_projection":[{"pdf_page":50,"half":"左","leaf":"九上","column_from_right":7,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"王凝之妻謝氏字道韞安西將軍奕之女也聰識有才"},{"pdf_page":50,"half":"左","leaf":"九上","column_from_right":8,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"辯叔父安嘗問毛詩何句最佳道韞稱吉甫作頌穆如"},{"pdf_page":50,"half":"左","leaf":"九上","column_from_right":9,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"清風仲山甫永懷以慰其心安謂有雅人深致又嘗內"},{"pdf_page":50,"half":"左","leaf":"九上","column_from_right":10,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"集俄而雪驟下安曰何所似也安兄子朗曰散鹽空中"},{"pdf_page":51,"half":"右","leaf":"九下","column_from_right":1,"start":0,"end":16,"text":"差可擬道韞曰未若柳絮因風起安大悅"}]},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun-wyd","book_id":"b-jinshu-096","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-096-daoyun-wyd1916"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p001","text":"王凝之妻謝氏，字道韞，安西將軍奕之女也。聰識有才辯。叔父安嘗問：「《毛詩》何句最佳？」道韞稱：「吉甫作頌，穆如清風。仲山甫永懷，以慰其心。」安謂有雅人深致。又嘗內集，俄而雪驟下，安曰：「何所似也？」安兄子朗曰：「散鹽空中差可擬。」道韞曰：「未若柳絮因風起。」安大悅。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"王凝之","person_id":"f7d_ipd_k1o","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"謝氏","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CE","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p001:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"道韞","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CE","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p001:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"奕","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_C","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按相連人名、語法及所行之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xie